{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20022132,"chapterID":15001403,"chapterNumber":"XIV-3","sectionNumber":"143-23","title":"Special Height and Setback Regulations","officialText":"","previewText":"For the purposes of this Section, Watts Street, West Broadway, Centre Street, and Great Jones Street shall be considered wide streets.\n\nThe applicable height and setback regulations are modified as follows:\n\n(a) Street wall location\n\nThe street wall location provisions of paragraph (a) of Section 35-631 shall apply to all street frontages, except that the street wall shall extend to at least the minimum base height a","blocks":[{"id":"zr-22132-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>For the purposes of this Section, Watts Street, West Broadway, Centre Street, and Great Jones Street shall be considered <strong><em>wide streets</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"For the purposes of this Section, Watts Street, West Broadway, Centre Street, and Great Jones Street shall be considered wide streets."},{"id":"zr-22132-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>The applicable height and setback regulations are modified as follows:</span></p>","plainText":"The applicable height and setback regulations are modified as follows:"},{"id":"zr-22132-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"pseudo-li\" style=\"margin-left: 43pt;text-indent: -43pt;\"><span>(a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><em>Street wall</em></strong> location</span></p>","plainText":"(a) Street wall location"},{"id":"zr-22132-block-004","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>The <strong><em>street wall</em></strong> location provisions of paragraph (a) of Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-5#35-631\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-5#35-631\"><span>35-631</span></a> shall apply to all <strong><em>street</em></strong> frontages, except that the <strong><em>street wall</em></strong> shall extend to at least the minimum base height as set forth in paragraph (b) of this Section, or the height of the <strong><em>building</em></strong>, whichever is less. On <strong><em>through lots</em></strong>, the additional regulations set forth in paragraph (b) of Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-3#23-436\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-ii/chapter-3#23-436\"><span>23-436</span></a> shall not apply.</span></p>","plainText":"The street wall location provisions of paragraph (a) of Section 35-631 shall apply to all street frontages, except that the street wall shall extend to at least the minimum base height as set forth in paragraph (b) of this Section, or the height of the building, whichever is less. On through lots, the additional regulations set forth in paragraph (b) of Section 23-436 shall not apply."},{"id":"zr-22132-block-005","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"pseudo-li\" style=\"margin-left: 43pt;text-indent: -43pt;\"><span>(b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Base heights and maximum <strong><em>building</em></strong> heights</span></p>","plainText":"(b) Base heights and maximum building heights"},{"id":"zr-22132-block-006","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>The table below sets forth the minimum and maximum base height, and maximum <strong><em>building</em></strong> height for all <strong><em>buildings</em></strong>.</span></p>","plainText":"The table below sets forth the minimum and maximum base height, and maximum building height for all buildings."},{"id":"zr-22132-block-007","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>A setback is required for all portions of a <strong><em>building</em></strong> that exceed the maximum base height specified for the applicable district and shall be provided in accordance with paragraph (c) of this Section.</span></p>","plainText":"A setback is required for all portions of a building that exceed the maximum base height specified for the applicable district and shall be provided in accordance with paragraph (c) of this Section."},{"id":"zr-22132-block-008","kind":"html","html":"<p class=\"center-align\"><span>MINIMUM BASE HEIGHT, MAXIMUM BASE HEIGHT, </span><br><span>AND MAXIMUM BUILDING HEIGHTS</span></p>","plainText":"MINIMUM BASE HEIGHT, MAXIMUM BASE HEIGHT, AND MAXIMUM BUILDING HEIGHTS"},{"id":"zr-22132-block-009","kind":"html","html":"<p><a id=\"t.2b2649c59a7d9246c8e2654d8513d14f747847b3\"></a><a id=\"t.0\"></a></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-22132-block-010","kind":"table","html":"<table style=\"margin-left:30.6pt;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:171.9pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t<p><span>District</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:80.5pt;border-top-color:</em></strong>000000;border-bottom-style:solid\">\n\t\t\t<p><span>Minimum base height (in feet)</span></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1p